pub const COVERAGE_1: &str = "Original findings and source statuses remain in the [historical register](../00-governance/technical-validation.md#research-assessment-baseline). Current metadata comes from `validation/register/validations/`. Mapping identifies investigations; it does not establish completed tests or acceptance. The [methodology](methodology.md) explains those gates.";
